# Files & naming

```
src/
  app/           # routes, layouts, API controllers
  components/
    ui/          # reusable primitives
    founder/     # founder feature UI
    investor/    # investor feature UI
  hooks/
  lib/           # openrouter client, utils
  models/        # domain types
  services/      # business + agent logic
  stores/        # client UI state only
```

- Components: `PascalCase.tsx`
- Hooks: `useThing.ts`
- Services: `camelCase` file, exported class or functions matching domain (`verificationService.ts`)
- Schemas: `thing.schema.ts` next to or under `models/`
- Prefer one export concern per file; split when a file exceeds ~200 lines of real logic
